  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: io-boundaries on a one-file fixture reports Kernel.send, Process.spawn, Process.monitor, GenServer.reply and Task.Supervisor.async as external_potential; only Process.send reaches process_send; bare send(pid,x)/spawn(f) emit no calls edge at all (survey). elixir.yaml process_send rows unchanged. Caveat for the fix shape: WI-bavat disputes erlang's own register/monitor/link process_send rows, so mirror only send/spawn/reply/start/stop until it rules; WI-taluz's four receiver shapes do not include the bare call. MECHANISM: elixir catalogue rows only the moved spellings; analyzer emits no edge for an unqualified Kernel-imported call. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-bavat,WI-nusol."  # 09dd
