rver.call/cast, Process.send or Task.*; erlang's equivalent has one. Recall, not precision. The bare-call form needs an analyzer-side answer (how a Kernel import is slotted), not only rows.\nFix shape: rows under process_send mirroring erlang's, plus a reach test per spelling; the bare form first needs the elixir analyzer to name Kernel as the module of an unqualified Kernel call -- check WI-taluz (four dot-call receiver shapes) for overlap before starting."  # 1d90
